y_count":1},{"business_id":"mhrW9O0O5hXGXGnEYBVoag","name":"Jacques-Imo's Cafe","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"8KnMSrMuTI2AtHZ2LOI8OQ","name":"Maurepas Foods","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"_Bi9kN_eR75G1eqIl7S3pA","name":"The Bulldog","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"5rScKeYVjFk8VahsvJv9QA","review_id":"bPnULaiFqlO9XpmRmuJfzw","date":"2013-02-14T15:30:34","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9635024070739746,"text_excerpt":"Mikimoto is, by far, my favorite place for sushi in New Orleans and a much frequented spot by myself + girlfriend + friends. The dine-in staff is always super friendly and helpful, delivery is speedy, and the range of rolls and platters I've tried have been consistently great. Parking is a real nuisance, so I find myself getting delivery more often. Don't let that dissuade you from checking out their small-yet-charming dining room, though. It's always clean, and patrons are very well attended to. This plus the aforementioned consistency in food quality make for a great experience. I don't think Mikimoto will ever serve the most amazing sushi I'll have in my life, but I am confident that I..."},{"business_id":"5rScKeYVjFk8VahsvJv9QA","review_id":"2sh0J_bK4T4DdZM0ccsr8Q","date":"2011-08-14T18:38:51","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9561386108398438,"text_excerpt":"This is my go-to spot for sushi in New Orleans. The fish is fresh, the prices are reasonable, and the service is quick and friendly. The drive-up take-out window makes satisfying sushi cravings maybe a little too easy. My favorites are the crunchy dynamite roll and the chef's special roll, and the rainbow roll is one of the best I've had. They're not as creative as some of the other places in town with the big, fancy, crazily-named rolls that you can't fit in your mouth in one bite, but if you're looking for good sushi at a reasonable price, Mikimoto is your spot. Two people can have a variety of normal-sized rolls and sushi and be full for $30. I would stick with the sushi, I haven't lov..."},{"business_id":"5rScKeYVjFk8VahsvJv9QA","review_id":"SF0gj_QZTT8ippJTkGD6_Q","date":"2015-11-22T05:51:31","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.953819990158081,"text_excerpt":"The go-to place for sushi whenever I'm craving and in Mid-city. All the fish are fresh, and the complimentary noodle salad is my favorite! The best roll I had here is the Wholly Roll. Before people say it's kind of pricey, the roll pieces are pretty big and filling.. I could barely fit one whole piece in my mouth. The baked mussels is also pretty good. You know what? I believe everything on the menu is flavorful. The restaurant even has a drive-thru! What sushi restaurant do you know that has one? So convenient for to-go orders! I love this place. If you ever hesitate on going here? Don't, 'cause you'll definitely like it."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"5rScKeYVjFk8VahsvJv9QA","photo_id":"wMpmyBO9e1Y7hIbT59i-YA","label":"menu","image_url":"/photos/wMpmyBO9e1Y7hIbT59i-YA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8565152883529663},{"business_id":"5rScKeYVjFk8VahsvJv9QA","photo_id":"-ecJQYpmYC8KqSIlrjS7lg","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/-ecJQYpmYC8KqSIlrjS7lg.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8318995237350464},{"business_id":"5rScKeYVjFk8VahsvJv9QA","photo_id":"Wg9izOrPuHj1mFT2CrascA","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/Wg9izOrPuHj1mFT2CrascA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.